{
  "name": "INSUR AI - Análisis PDF por Email (IMAP)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚙️ CONFIGURACIÓN REQUERIDA\n\n**Credenciales a configurar:**\n- `IMAP Account` → buzón de entrada donde llegan los PDFs\n- `SMTP Account` → para enviar respuestas\n\n**Cómo enviar un PDF para análisis:**\nEnvía un email con:\n- Asunto que contenga: `ANALIZAR` (o ajusta el filtro en el trigger)\n- Adjunto: el PDF del informe de proveedores\n\n**Variable de entorno:**\n- `BACKEND_URL` = `http://insur-backend:8000`",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "sticky-setup",
      "name": "Nota - Configuración Email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-240, 40]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📥 Trigger Email\nEscucha el buzón IMAP cada 5 minutos.\nFiltro: emails con adjunto PDF cuyo asunto contenga `ANALIZAR`.\n\nEl adjunto binario se pasa directamente a `POST /extract`.",
        "height": 140,
        "width": 340,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "sticky-trigger",
      "name": "Nota - Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [0, 40]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📊 Pipeline ML\n1. `/extract` → texto + tablas del PDF\n2. `/ml/full` → segmentación, comportamiento, forecast\n3. `/generate-prd` → PRD completo vía Claude",
        "height": 140,
        "width": 540,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "sticky-pipeline",
      "name": "Nota - Pipeline",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [380, 40]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📤 Respuesta por Email\n**HIGH risk** → email urgente al equipo de riesgo\n**MED / LOW** → email informe al remitente original",
        "height": 120,
        "width": 340,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "sticky-output",
      "name": "Nota - Output",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [960, 40]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "pollTimes": {
          "item": [
            {
              "mode": "everyMinutes",
              "value": 5
            }
          ]
        },
        "mailbox": "INBOX",
        "options": {
          "allowUnauthorizedCerts": false,
          "downloadAttachments": true,
          "dataPropertyAttachmentsPrefixName": "attachment_"
        }
      },
      "id": "email-trigger",
      "name": "Email Trigger (IMAP)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailReadImap",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [0, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "imap": {
          "id": "imap-creds",
          "name": "IMAP Account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": false,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-subject",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.subject }}",
              "rightValue": "ANALIZAR",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "contains"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "if-valid-email",
      "name": "IF - Email Válido",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [240, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "assign-sender",
              "name": "sender_email",
              "value": "={{ $json.from.value[0].address }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "assign-sender-name",
              "name": "sender_name",
              "value": "={{ $json.from.value[0].name || $json.from.value[0].address }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "assign-subject",
              "name": "original_subject",
              "value": "={{ $json.subject }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "assign-date",
              "name": "received_at",
              "value": "={{ $json.date }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "set-email-meta",
      "name": "Set - Metadatos Email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.3,
      "position": [480, 200]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.BACKEND_URL || 'http://insur-backend:8000' }}/extract",
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "multipart-form-data",
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "parameterType": "formBinaryData",
              "name": "file",
              "inputDataFieldName": "attachment_0"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "http-extract",
      "name": "POST - Extract PDF",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [480, 360]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.BACKEND_URL || 'http://insur-backend:8000' }}/ml/full",
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ full_text: $json.extraction.full_text, horizon_days: 90 }) }}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "http-ml-full",
      "name": "POST - ML Full Analysis",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [720, 360]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.BACKEND_URL || 'http://insur-backend:8000' }}/generate-prd",
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ ...JSON.parse(JSON.stringify($json)), extraction: { full_text: $node[\"POST - Extract PDF\"].json.extraction.full_text } }) }}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "http-generate-prd",
      "name": "POST - Generate PRD",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [960, 360]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "assign-prd",
              "name": "prd_text",
              "value": "={{ $json.prd_text }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "assign-run",
              "name": "run_id",
              "value": "={{ $node[\"POST - ML Full Analysis\"].json.run_id }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "assign-high",
              "name": "high_risk_count",
              "value": "={{ $node[\"POST - ML Full Analysis\"].json.segmentation.output.summary.high_risk }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "assign-total",
              "name": "total_suppliers",
              "value": "={{ $node[\"POST - ML Full Analysis\"].json.segmentation.output.summary.total_suppliers }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "assign-med",
              "name": "med_risk_count",
              "value": "={{ $node[\"POST - ML Full Analysis\"].json.segmentation.output.summary.med_risk }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "assign-alerts",
              "name": "risk_alerts_count",
              "value": "={{ $node[\"POST - ML Full Analysis\"].json.decisions.risk_alerts.length }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "assign-sender",
              "name": "sender_email",
              "value": "={{ $node[\"Set - Metadatos Email\"].json.sender_email }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "assign-sender-name",
              "name": "sender_name",
              "value": "={{ $node[\"Set - Metadatos Email\"].json.sender_name }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "set-summary",
      "name": "Set - Resumen Resultado",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.3,
      "position": [1200, 360]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": false,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-high",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.high_risk_count }}",
              "rightValue": 0,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "gt"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "or"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "if-high-risk",
      "name": "IF - Alto Riesgo",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1440, 360]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "insur-ai@company.com",
        "toEmail": "={{ $env.RISK_TEAM_EMAIL || 'riesgo@company.com' }}",
        "ccEmail": "={{ $json.sender_email }}",
        "subject": "🚨 [URGENTE] INSUR AI — {{ $json.high_risk_count }} proveedores ALTO RIESGO (run: {{ $json.run_id }})",
        "emailType": "html",
        "message": "<h2 style='color:#dc2626;font-family:sans-serif'>🚨 Alerta de Riesgo Alto — INSUR AI</h2>\n<p style='font-family:sans-serif'><strong>Solicitado por:</strong> {{ $json.sender_name }} ({{ $json.sender_email }})</p>\n<table style='border-collapse:collapse;font-family:sans-serif;margin-bottom:16px'>\n  <tr><td style='padding:8px 16px;background:#fef2f2;border:1px solid #fca5a5'><strong>🔴 Alto riesgo</strong></td><td style='padding:8px 16px;border:1px solid #fca5a5'>{{ $json.high_risk_count }}</td></tr>\n  <tr><td style='padding:8px 16px;background:#fffbeb;border:1px solid #fcd34d'><strong>🟡 Riesgo medio</strong></td><td style='padding:8px 16px;border:1px solid #fcd34d'>{{ $json.med_risk_count }}</td></tr>\n  <tr><td style='padding:8px 16px;background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #86efac'><strong>✅ Total analizados</strong></td><td style='padding:8px 16px;border:1px solid #86efac'>{{ $json.total_suppliers }}</td></tr>\n  <tr><td style='padding:8px 16px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0'><strong>⚠️ Alertas activas</strong></td><td style='padding:8px 16px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0'>{{ $json.risk_alerts_count }}</td></tr>\n</table>\n<hr>\n<h3 style='font-family:sans-serif'>📄 PRD Generado (run: {{ $json.run_id }})</h3>\n<pre style='background:#f1f5f9;padding:16px;border-radius:8px;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:13px'>{{ $json.prd_text }}</pre>",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "email-urgent",
      "name": "Email - Alerta Urgente",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [1680, 220],
      "credentials": {
        "smtp": {
          "id": "smtp-creds",
          "name": "SMTP Account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "insur-ai@company.com",
        "toEmail": "={{ $json.sender_email }}",
        "subject": "✅ INSUR AI — Análisis completado: {{ $json.total_suppliers }} proveedores analizados (run: {{ $json.run_id }})",
        "emailType": "html",
        "message": "<h2 style='color:#0f172a;font-family:sans-serif'>📋 Informe de Análisis de Proveedores — INSUR AI</h2>\n<p style='font-family:sans-serif'>Hola {{ $json.sender_name }},</p>\n<p style='font-family:sans-serif'>Aquí tienes los resultados del análisis de tu documento PDF de proveedores.</p>\n<table style='border-collapse:collapse;font-family:sans-serif;margin-bottom:16px'>\n  <tr><td style='padding:8px 16px;background:#fef2f2;border:1px solid #fca5a5'><strong>🔴 Alto riesgo</strong></td><td style='padding:8px 16px;border:1px solid #fca5a5'>{{ $json.high_risk_count }}</td></tr>\n  <tr><td style='padding:8px 16px;background:#fffbeb;border:1px solid #fcd34d'><strong>🟡 Riesgo medio</strong></td><td style='padding:8px 16px;border:1px solid #fcd34d'>{{ $json.med_risk_count }}</td></tr>\n  <tr><td style='padding:8px 16px;background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #86efac'><strong>✅ Total analizados</strong></td><td style='padding:8px 16px;border:1px solid #86efac'>{{ $json.total_suppliers }}</td></tr>\n</table>\n<hr>\n<h3 style='font-family:sans-serif'>📄 PRD Completo</h3>\n<pre style='background:#f1f5f9;padding:16px;border-radius:8px;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:13px'>{{ $json.prd_text }}</pre>\n<hr>\n<p style='font-family:sans-serif;color:#64748b;font-size:12px'>Generado por INSUR AI · Run ID: {{ $json.run_id }}</p>",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "email-report",
      "name": "Email - Informe al Remitente",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [1680, 500],
      "credentials": {
        "smtp": {
          "id": "smtp-creds",
          "name": "SMTP Account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "insur-ai@company.com",
        "toEmail": "={{ $node[\"Email Trigger (IMAP)\"].json.from.value[0].address }}",
        "subject": "RE: {{ $node[\"Email Trigger (IMAP)\"].json.subject }} — Email sin adjunto PDF válido",
        "emailType": "text",
        "message": "Hola,\n\nHemos recibido tu solicitud de análisis, pero no encontramos un archivo PDF adjunto.\n\nPor favor reenvía el email con el PDF del informe de proveedores adjunto y el asunto debe contener la palabra ANALIZAR.\n\nGracias,\nINSUR AI",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "email-no-pdf",
      "name": "Email - Sin PDF Adjunto",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [480, 520],
      "credentials": {
        "smtp": {
          "id": "smtp-creds",
          "name": "SMTP Account"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "pinData": {},
  "connections": {
    "Email Trigger (IMAP)": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "IF - Email Válido",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "IF - Email Válido": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Set - Metadatos Email",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          },
          {
            "node": "POST - Extract PDF",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "Email - Sin PDF Adjunto",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "POST - Extract PDF": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "POST - ML Full Analysis",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "POST - ML Full Analysis": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "POST - Generate PRD",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "POST - Generate PRD": {
      "main": [
